# PSR-5f — background_repair admin capability

## Scope discipline

**20** non-spec `apps/api/src` files still call `getPrismaAdmin` under the
inventory class `background_repair` (~53 call sites). Bulk-migrate forbidden.

This wave:

1. Inventory every site with a stable reason code.
2. Introduce `getBackgroundAdminClient(reason)` —
   `apps/api/src/db/background-admin-client.ts` — metric
   `background_admin_access_total{reason}`.
3. Pilot **exactly three** reclaim siblings:
   - `outbox/outbox-processing-reclaim.ts` → `BG_OUTBOX_RECLAIM`
   - `http/http-idempotency-reclaim.ts` → `BG_HTTP_IDEMPOTENCY_RECLAIM`
   - `integrations/worker/integration-delivery-processing-reclaim.ts` →
     `BG_INTEGRATION_WORKER`

Remaining 17 stay direct until follow-up clusters (outbox ops/relay/replay,
finance recon, integration migration, events).

## Reason taxonomy (11)

| Reason | Count (files) |
| --- | ---: |
| `BG_OUTBOX_OPS` | 3 |
| `BG_OUTBOX_REPLAY` | 3 |
| `BG_OUTBOX_RECLAIM` | 1 |
| `BG_OUTBOX_RELAY` | 1 |
| `BG_OUTBOX_RECONCILE` | 1 |
| `BG_FINANCE_RECON` | 5 |
| `BG_INTEGRATION_MIGRATION` | 2 |
| `BG_INTEGRATION_DELIVERY` | 1 |
| `BG_INTEGRATION_WORKER` | 1 |
| `BG_HTTP_IDEMPOTENCY_RECLAIM` | 1 |
| `BG_EVENTS` | 1 |

## Non-goals

- Rewriting outbox/finance algorithms
- Identity allowlist
- Dual-store cleanup

## Ratchet

```bash
node scripts/ops/psr-5f-background-admin-smoke.mjs
node scripts/ops/psr-5-data-authority-inventory-smoke.mjs
```
